{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"Now all uncertainty has finally been put to an end, and I have the express coach ticket in my pocket. — Yesterday I received the answer that all seats for Tuesday and Friday were taken, but that persons might perhaps still be found for separate coaches. — Upon today’s inquiry, three Prague residents presented themselves along with me, but instead for Tuesday — for Wednesday; so I had to, against my will — but to be certain of the matter — concede one day. In 36 hours I shall then be in Prague and half the distance closer to you, — if only this second half could be covered just as quickly, to be soon with you, my dear, and among you, — there first to rest with you — to tell you — though little will remain that I have not already told in writing — to let you tell me all the more — and also to work."}}],"created":1795220659,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":179,"prompt_tokens":264,"total_tokens":443,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-h8HOxFe4GvbhojrXTzLhbRfDXl9wxJ1G","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":264,"prompt_ms":413.318,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.5655984848484847,"prompt_per_second":638.7333723670394,"predicted_n":179,"predicted_ms":4076.289,"predicted_per_token_ms":22.9005,"predicted_per_second":43.667168839108314}}